==Description==
'''Biologist Menace''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]] by triumphing [[Bathroom Approach]] on the Hard difficulty twice. The second triumph had to be done 64 hours after the first triumph.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the [[Biologist]] holding its [[Nightshade (Unit)|Nightshade]] plant in its left hand. It plays a sound of a canister breaking upon use.

